# Pregunta 3 - Registrar notas de Ana
POST http://localhost:3000/courses/PW/grades
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "studentCode": "20231234",
    "studentName": "Ana Torres",
    "practices": [12, 15, 9, 18],
    "midterm": 14,
    "final": 16
}

